        "kind": "prompt",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 400
        },
        "config": {
          "text": "SHORT-FORM BRIEF \u2014 edit before running.\nFormat: hyperlapse city morph\nTopic: history facts\nHook (first 1.5s): [one line]\nPayoff: [one line]\nOn-screen text: [exact copy or leave blank]\nRuntime: 12s, 9:16, sound-on by default."
        },
        "name": "Short-form brief"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_810ZWMJG8D6FR6C0GPQDVX9B1H",
        "kind": "sticky-note",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": -60
        },
        "config": {
          "text": "STAGE 1 \u2014 format-native hook planning. The first 1.5 seconds carry the whole retention load."
        },
        "name": "Stage 1"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_M143W6TAWXGD8FNB5EEX65990C",
        "kind": "sticky-note",
        "position": {
          "x": 2100,
          "y": -60
        },
        "config": {
          "text": "STAGE 2 \u2014 render, finish and collect. Built for 9:16 sound-on playback."
        },
        "name": "Stage 2"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_5G1JCG8VH1PQ27D66E9MT1YB3B",
        "kind": "text-gen",
        "position": {
          "x": 700,
          "y": 400
        },
        "config": {
          "model": "gpt-5.5",
          "max_tokens": 1400,
          "temperature": 0.98,
          "system_prompt": "You are a short-form creative director writing a hyperlapse city morph about history facts for a vertical feed.\n\nRETENTION. The first 1.5 seconds must contain a visual question the viewer needs resolved. Plan an explicit beat every 2 to 3 seconds; nothing static may hold longer than that.\n\nFORMAT LAW. Honour the grammar of the hyperlapse city morph \u2014 its native framing, its edit rhythm, and the specific thing audiences expect from it. If the format loops, the last frame must match the first.\n\nCAMERA. Compose 9:16 with the action in the safe centre band. Use a jib reveal rising over a foreground object on a 105mm macro, framing with a shallow out-of-focus foreground element occluding the lower third.\n\nLOOK AND SOUND. Light with a beauty dish above the lens axis with a silver reflector under the chin; grade as high-contrast teal-and-orange with protected mid-tone skin. Specify the sound design in one clause \u2014 what the viewer hears in the first second decides whether they stay.\n\nOUTPUT. Return ONE image-generation prompt as a single unbroken paragraph. No preamble, no headings, no bullet points, no commentary, no markdown."
        },
        "name": "Format director"
      },
      {
        "id": "nd_CS05XV9ZHVT5GKC7DZJ78KG955",
        "kind": "image-input",
        "position": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 700
